exports[`template welcome_1 > matches its snapshot (subject, html, text) > text 1`] = `
"CleverDeals https://filament.cleverdeals.net/?utm_source=email&utm_medium=marketing&utm_campaign=welcome_1&eid=33333333-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

Thanks for signing up. We stock PLA, PETG, ABS, ASA and TPU from makers we trust, 1.75 mm on 1 kg spools, and we ship fast across the UK.

Not sure which material suits a job? PLA is the easy all-rounder; PETG is tougher and copes with heat; ABS and ASA are for parts that live outdoors or near warmth; TPU is for anything that needs to flex.

----------------------------------------

You are getting this because you asked to hear from CleverDeals. Use the links below to choose what we send, or to stop marketing emails.

Unsubscribe https://filament.cleverdeals.net/email/u/TOKEN_abc · Email preferences https://filament.cleverdeals.net/email/preferences/TOKEN_abc

CleverDeals is a trading name of TBV Limited, registered in England and Wales, company number 13279893. Registered office: Suite 48, Beechfield House, Winterton Way, Macclesfield, SK11 0LP. VAT GB 378 4829 39.

Questions? Reply to this email or write to sales@cleverdeals.net."
`;

